# Keeps the Docker build context (used by dubai-lead-matching-service/Dockerfile,
# built from this directory) small and free of secrets/session material --
# only src/, scripts/lib/, sql/, and dubai-lead-matching-service/ are ever
# actually COPYed into the image.
.git
# `**/` matches at any depth, not just the build-context root -- a plain
# ".env" pattern here would NOT catch dubai-lead-matching-service/.env (found the
# hard way: a built image had the real local .env, OPENAI_API_KEY
# included, baked into a layer via `COPY dubai-lead-matching-service .`).
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
node_modules
dubai-lead-matching-service/node_modules
dashboard
n8n
docs
tests
dubai-lead-matching-service/tests
reference
**/*.log
